{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"big\": \"X\",\n    \"small\": \"Y\",\n    \"core\": \"Y\",\n    \"concise\": \"Y\",\n    \"human\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\",\n    \"load\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"big：X 的大块直接交代人物处境、心理变化和前后转折，单看大字也能串起叙事；Y 有些加亮词脱离小字后信息不完整，例如 S10 的“最舍不得的”缺少具体对象。small：Y 的小字提供了更多记忆触发、身体反应和听觉体验的补充，层次较丰富；X 有几处小字直接重复大字已经表达的意思。core、concise、human：Y 更清楚地呈现了不愿再受委屈、又舍不得旧日亲近与归属的反复拉扯，最后落到不再逼自己选边、带着想念继续生活；叙述合并得更好，口语也更自然，X 的“负隅顽抗”“不甘心就这样消亡”“带着想念继续站稳”等表达较生硬。fine：X 更常留下胸口发紧、后颈发凉、脚下失重等具体而有辨识度的身体体验；Y 有不少感受转而描述和弦、旋律和节奏本身。load：Y 虽然加亮块数量较多，但每块普遍较短，意群切分也较清楚；X 的大块包含较多完整长句，尤其在停留较短的屏幕上，扫读负担更重。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "73da1dcc-7074-4471-b008-491cbb30839a", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261111T045902128100Z", "elapsed_seconds": 216.047, "completed_utc": "2026-11-11T05:02:38.183053+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "a5efee84b8a1ea5d4a988551fc7a1bc6e8c41638edf3ec488754cd723de198f7", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982